    "text": "Spiritus sanctus pro septenaria operatione, Isaia propheta testante, septiformis esse creditur in bono;\nSpiritus bonus spiritus sapientie, cui e contrario malus opponitur spiritus insipientie, alter peior\nSpiritus bonus spiritus intellectus, malus autem spiritus stultitie, alter peior simulatio discipline.\nSpiritus bonus spiritus consilii, malus autem spiritus inprouidentiae, alter peior simulatio prouidentiae.\nSpiritus bonus spiritus fortitudinis, cui opponitur malus aperte ignauie spiritus, alter peior infirmitas\nSpiritus bonus spiritus scientie, cui contrarius malus spiritus ignorantie, nequior autem usurpatio\nSpiritus bonus spiritus pietatis, malus uero spiritus impietatis, alter peior false pietatis obtentus.\nSpiritus bonus spiritus timoris Dei, cui contrarius est spiritus temeritatis, alter peior dolus ficte\nBe \u00f0am Seofanfealdan Godes Gyfan.\nIsaias se witega awrat on his witegunge be \u00f0am halgan gaste & be his vii fealdum gifum.\n\u00dea seofonfealdan gyfa synd \u00feus genamode: sapientia on Leden, \u00fe\u00e6t is wisdom on Englisc; intellectus\n\u00d0as seofanfealdan gyfa so\u00f0lice w\u00e6ron on urum Drihtne be fullum \u00f0ingum, & se halga gast hi tod\u00e6l\u00f0\nAnd witodlice se man h\u00e6f\u00f0 wisdom \u00feurh Godes gyfe \u00fee wislice leofa\u00f0 & symle smea\u00f0 hu he Gode\nAnd se h\u00e6f\u00f0 god angyt \u00feurh Godes gyfe \u00fee hit gewent to his Drihtnes willan mid godum weorcum\nAnd se h\u00e6f\u00f0 godne r\u00e6d \u00feurh Godes gyfe \u00fee him ger\u00e6da\u00f0 \u00e6fre hw\u00e6t him to donne sy & hw\u00e6t to\nAnd se h\u00e6f\u00f0 modes strenc\u00f0e \u00f0urh Godes gyfe \u00fee mycel m\u00e6g forberan & ge\u00f0olian & on eallum\nAnd se h\u00e6f\u00f0 god ingehyd \u00feurh Godes gyfe \u00fee godnysse & bilewitnysse lufa\u00f0 & bi\u00f0 betera wi\u00f0innan\nAnd se h\u00e6f\u00f0 arf\u00e6stnysse \u00feurh Godes gyfe \u00fee arf\u00e6st by\u00f0 & m\u00e6\u00f0e cann on o\u00f0rum mannum, on his\nAnd \u00feonne is Godes ege seo seofo\u00f0e gifu \u00feissera gastlicra gifa, & seo gifu is angin ealles wisdomes.\nAnd se \u00f0e Godes ege fullice h\u00e6f\u00f0, ne forl\u00e6t he na fela \u00fe\u00e6s \u00fee his sawle \u00feearf bi\u00f0 to h\u00e6bbenne & to\nAnd se man \u00fee bi\u00f0 bed\u00e6led ealra \u00f0issa seofan gifa nis he na Gode wyr\u00f0 ne to Gode belimp\u00f0, ne he\nNu h\u00e6f\u00f0 se yfela gast & se ungesawenlica feond herongean seofonfealde ungifa \u00fe\u00e6t syn un\u00feearfa\nAnd \u00fea yfelan ungifa \u00fe\u00e6s arleasan deofles syndan \u00feus genamode on Ledengereorde: insipientia, \u00fe\u00e6t is\n\u00c6lc riht wisdom is cumen of Gode, for\u00f0am \u00fee God sylf is se so\u00f0a wisdom, & \u00e6lc man bi\u00f0 ges\u00e6lig &\nSe wisdom is, swa we \u00e6r cw\u00e6don, \u00fe\u00e6t halgan gastes gifu, & deofol s\u00e6w\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6rtogeanes unwisdom &\nAnd ongean \u00feam andgyte \u00fee of Godes agenre gyfe cym\u00f0 se deofol s\u00e6w\u00f0 andgytleste & eac gede\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t\nAnd ongean \u00feam wislican r\u00e6de \u00fee of Godes agenre gyfe cym\u00f0 se wi\u00f0err\u00e6da deofol s\u00e6w\u00f0 receleasnesse\nAnd ongean modsta\u00f0olnysse & modes strenc\u00f0e \u00fee of Godes agenre gyfe cym\u00f0 se manfulla deofol\nAnd ongean \u00feam ingehyde & gearawitolnesse \u00fee of Godes agenre gife cym\u00f0 se hetola deofol s\u00e6w\u00f0 &\nAnd ongean \u00fea arf\u00e6stnysse \u00fee of Godes agenre gyfe cym\u00f0 deofol s\u00e6w\u00f0 & sende\u00f0 arleasnesse & gel\u00e6r\u00f0\nAnd ongean \u00feam anfealdan Godes ege \u00fee of Godes agenre gife cym\u00f0 se grimlica deofol l\u00e6r\u00f0\nNis n\u00e6fre nan wyrse yfel ne Gode la\u00f0re \u00feonne \u00fe\u00e6t gehiwode yfel, for\u00f0an deofol sylf hit gefada\u00f0 &\nAnd to fela manna wyr\u00f0 \u00feeah mid \u00feyllican wrencan \u00feurh deofol forl\u00e6red, swa \u00fe\u00e6t hy eal o\u00f0er speca\u00f0\nAnd \u00fea beo\u00f0 rihtliceteras \u00fee to \u00f0am gewunia\u00f0.\nAnd mid \u00f0am unwrencan eallan bi\u00f0 huru se earmscapena man Antecrist eal afylled.\nHis word & weorc beo\u00f0 gode ge\u00f0uhte unweran mannum, & eal hy beo\u00f0 yfele & swicole.\nAc se \u00feeodlicetere hit gehiwa\u00f0 \u00feeah swa \u00fe\u00e6t l\u00e6st manna wat hu he him wi\u00f0 \u00feone \u00f0eodfeond\nAnd to fela manna eac is nu on \u00f0issere swicelan worulde \u00fee ealswa to swy\u00f0e \u00feurh hiwunge eal o\u00f0er\nAc eal \u00fe\u00e6t cym\u00f0 of deofle, \u00f0eah hy swa ne wenan, & \u00e6g\u00f0er hy deria\u00f0 mid swa geradan d\u00e6dan ge\nAnd swa gerade manswican \u00fee on \u00f0a wisan sw\u00e6slice swicia\u00f0 oftost on unriht & \u00f0urh \u00fe\u00e6t deria\u00f0 for\nCrist \u00e6lmihtig l\u00e6rde georne so\u00f0f\u00e6stnysse & anfealdnesse & \u00fe\u00e6t gehwa synnluste f\u00e6ste wi\u00f0stode, &\nAnd swa do\u00f0 \u00fea \u00feeodlogan eac \u00fee talia\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t to w\u00e6rscype \u00fe\u00e6t man cunne & m\u00e6ge lytelice swician &\nAc cwe\u00fea\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t to worde \u00fe\u00e6t se bi\u00f0 on ge\u00feance w\u00e6rast & wisast se \u00f0e o\u00f0erne can ra\u00f0ost asmeagean &\nCwe\u00fea\u00f0 eac to worde \u00fea \u00f0e syndan stunte \u00fe\u00e6t mycel forh\u00e6fednes lytel behealde, ac \u00fe\u00e6t mete w\u00e6re\nAnd so\u00f0 is \u00fe\u00e6t ic secge, mid eal swylcan laran Antecrist cweme\u00f0 & la\u00f0lice forl\u00e6re\u00f0 ealles to manege.\nFor\u00f0am nis \u00e6fre \u00e6nig lagu wyrse on worulde \u00feonne hwa folgie eallinge his luste & his lust him to\nAnd a swa nyr ende \u00feissere worulde swa wyr\u00f0 fyrenlusta & synlicra d\u00e6da a ma & ma mannum\nAc se bi\u00f0 ges\u00e6lig se \u00f0e gewarna\u00f0 huru hine sylfne be \u00e6nigum d\u00e6le.\nGod ure helpe.",
